OL,3,ABody recovered in search for man fallen
OL,4,Aoverboard on cruise ship
OL,5,
OL,6,FA body has been recovered in the search
OL,7,Ffor a man fallen overboard from a
OL,8,Fcruise ship in the North Sea off the
OL,9,Feast coast of Scotland
OL,11,FThe man was reported missing at 08:35
OL,12,Fon Ambassador Cruise Lines vessel MS
OL,13,FAmbition, about 36 nautical miles from
OL,14,FArbroath.
OL,16,FLifeboats, coastguard crews and aerial
OL,17,Fsupport were launched as part of a
OL,18,Fsearch operation before the ship docked
OL,19,Fin Dundee.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
