OL,3,ABody recovered in search for man fallen
OL,4,Aoverboard on cruise ship
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland said formal
OL,7,Fidentification was still to take place,
OL,8,Fbut the missing man's family had been
OL,9,Finformed.
